# The IaC Orchestration Platform Engineers Trust | Spacelift

Spacelift helps orchestrate your entire infrastructure pipeline (Terraform, OpenTofu, Ansible and more) to deliver secure, cost-effective, and high-performance infrastructure.

## Getting Started with Spacelift

- [Free trial](https://spacelift.io/free-trial): Explore Spacelift's features with a free trial to see how it can benefit your infrastructure management.
- [Book a demo](https://spacelift.io/schedule-demo): Get a technical walkthrough of Spacelift with an engineer.

## Understanding Spacelift

- [Platform Overview](https://spacelift.io/platform): See why DevOps and platform engineering teams choose Spacelift to orchestrate infrastructure as code, configuration, and governance at scale.
- [How it Works](https://spacelift.io/platform/how-it-works): Learn how Spacelift works and how it integrates with your cloud, VCS, and IaC tools.
- [Platform Capabilities](https://spacelift.io/platform/capabilities): Explore how Spacelift lets you provision, configure, and govern infrastructure from one platform.
- [Deployment Options](https://spacelift.io/platform/deployment-options): Compare SaaS, self-hosted, on-premises/air-gapped, and FedRAMP-authorized deployment models.
- [Spacelift Intelligence](https://spacelift.io/platform/intelligence): Learn how Spacelift's AI assistant helps teams understand, design, deploy, and govern infrastructure.
- [Spacelift Intent](https://spacelift.io/platform/intent): Provision cloud infrastructure with natural language, governed by the same policies as your IaC workflows.

## Integrations and Tools

- [Terraform](https://spacelift.io/terraform-at-scale): Explore how Spacelift integrates with Terraform for infrastructure as code.
- [Terraform Automation](https://spacelift.io/terraform-automation): Automate Terraform workflows with unlimited policies and automatic drift detection.
- [Ansible](https://spacelift.io/elevate-your-ansible-automation): Understand the capabilities of using Ansible within the Spacelift platform.
- [OpenTofu](https://spacelift.io/opentofu): Learn about the integration of OpenTofu with Spacelift for enhanced infrastructure management.
- [Spacelift for AWS](https://spacelift.io/aws): See how Spacelift integrates with AWS, including availability on the AWS Marketplace.
- [See all integrations](https://spacelift.io/platform/integrations): View a comprehensive list of IaC tools, source control, communication, observability, and cloud provider integrations.

## Comparisons

- [vs Terraform Cloud](https://spacelift.io/terraform-cloud-alternative): Compare Spacelift with Terraform Cloud to understand the differences and benefits.
- [Spacelift vs. Terraform Cloud (detailed comparison)](https://spacelift.io/terraform-cloud-vs-spacelift): A feature-by-feature comparison of Spacelift and Terraform Cloud for Terraform automation.
- [vs Terraform Enterprise](https://spacelift.io/terraform-enterprise-alternative): Analyze how Spacelift stacks up against Terraform Enterprise.
- [vs Atlantis](https://spacelift.io/atlantis-alternative): Review the features of Spacelift in comparison to Atlantis.
- [vs Generic CI/CD](https://spacelift.io/ci-cd-for-infrastructure): Evaluate Spacelift's capabilities against generic CI/CD solutions.

## Key Features

- [IaC at Scale](https://spacelift.io/infrastructure-at-scale): Learn how to scale your infrastructure safely and efficiently with Spacelift's end-to-end workflow.
- [Infrastructure Governance](https://spacelift.io/infrastructure-governance): Understand how Spacelift helps standardize and control infrastructure provisioning and configuration.
- [Collaboration](https://spacelift.io/collaboration): Discover how to implement and automate secure, collaborative workflows with Spacelift.
- [Developer Velocity](https://spacelift.io/developer-velocity): See how Spacelift simplifies provisioning and configuration for developers with a unified workflow.
- [Drift Detection](https://spacelift.io/drift-detection): Learn about Spacelift's drift detection capabilities to maintain infrastructure integrity.

